  "description": "Read-only health scoring of a Power Pages website across the dual adx_/mspp_ schemas. Detects the provisioned schema, inventories the site (pages, templates, page templates, snippets, site settings, web roles, table permissions, forms, lists, web files, redirects), and runs structural-integrity, site-settings, and security-surface rules to produce a 0–100 health score, configuration summary cards, and a categorized issue grid with recommendations. Exports Excel/PDF/Word/JSON/HTML/CSV.",
